{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04382","headline":"感遇诗三十八首 八 · 陈子昂","name":"感遇诗三十八首 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾观崑仑化，日月沦洞冥。\n精魄相交会，天壤以罗生。\n仲尼推太极，老聃贵窈冥。\n西方金仙子，崇义乃无明。\n空色皆寂灭，缘业定何成。\n名教信纷藉，死生俱未停。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04382.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04382","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}